vlc (3.0.22~rc1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  This release switches from lua 5.2 to lua 5.4. While the lua plugins included
  upstream are expected to be compatible with lua 5.4, custom scripts or plugins
  downloaded from third party sources might not work with lua 5.4. If you
  experience issues, please check whether you are using such plugins and update
  them to a lua 5.4 compatible version.

  For incompatibilities between lua 5.4 and previous versions, please check
  https://www.lua.org/manual/5.4/manual.html#8.

 -- Sebastian Ramacher <sramacher@debian.org>  Sun, 28 Sep 2025 13:01:35 +0200
